  "finalText": "I rebooked all 8 passengers from the cancelled ZX 400 (FRA→JFK). Everyone kept their cabin, and each booking group is together on one flight. ZX 400 now has no passengers left.\n\n| Booking | Passengers | Cabin | New flight |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| NV8P2L | Anna Novak | Economy | ZX 402, 2 Nov 18:00 |\n| BG5J3R | Tom Berger | Economy | ZX 402, 2 Nov 18:00 |\n| LD9C6W | Sara Lind | Business | ZX 402, 2 Nov 18:00 |\n| HZ4K7Q | Jan, Maja and Luka Horvat | Economy | ZX 404, 3 Nov 07:00 |\n| RS2M9D | Elena and Marco Rossi | Business | ZX 406, 3 Nov 10:00 |\n\nTwo groups couldn't go on the earliest flight, ZX 402, because it was too small for them:\n- **Horvat family:** ZX 402 had only 2 free Economy seats for the 3 of them. ZX 404 was the next flight with 3 free.\n- **Rossis:** ZX 402 had only 1 free Business seat and ZX 404 had none. ZX 406 was the first flight with 2 free.\n\nThe Economy seats on ZX 402 went to Anna Novak and Tom Berger. Even if the Horvats had been placed first, they still wouldn't have fit there, so every group got the earliest flight it could.",
